### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api

### ==================== 1. HEALTH CHECK ====================
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### ==================== 2. REGISTRO (crear usuario nuevo) ====================
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nuevo@ejemplo.com",
  "name": "Nuevo Usuario",
  "password": "123456"
}

### ==================== 3. LOGIN (con el usuario recién creado) ====================
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nuevo@ejemplo.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### ==================== 4. CONFIGURAR TOKEN ====================
### Elige UNA de estas opciones (prueba la primera primero)

# Opción A (más común)
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}

# Opción B (con $)
# @authToken = {{login.response.body.$.token}}

# Opción C (sin .body)
# @authToken = {{login.response.$.token}}

### ==================== 5. PETICIONES CON TOKEN ====================

### Listar libros
GET {{baseUrl}}/books
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Solicitar préstamo
POST {{baseUrl}}/loans/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Ver mis préstamos
GET {{baseUrl}}/loans
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Devolver Libro (usa el ID del préstamo que te dio el paso anterior)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/loans/1/return
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Crear reseña
POST {{baseUrl}}/books/1/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Excelente libro"
}